HandType 1.1.0
• Write your own handwriting on screen, nine letters per page, or print the sheet straight from the app (Premium).
• Accented letters such as é, ñ, ç, å, and German Ä Ö Ü ä ö ü ß.
• Text size slider on the result screen that shows the new size while you drag.
• Write in the message box with a stylus (Android 14 and newer).
• New Generate animation, a note preview in the share sheet, and better reading of filled-in sheets.
